#
# prompt_off_setup — the `off` prompt theme: every prompt at its plainest.
# Measured against zsh 5.9.2: PS1 `%# `, PS2 `> `, PS3 `?# `, PS4 `+> `,
# and no right-hand prompts.

PS1='%# '
PS2='> '
PS3='?# '
PS4='+> '
unset RPS1 RPS2
